QuasiFeffermanB.caloric_criticalEnergy_one_le_enstrophy : ∀ (N : ℕ) (c : SingularClosure.FourierCoeff),
  SingularClosure.criticalEnergy 1 N c ≤ SingularClosure.coefficientDissipation N c
